"""The nine diseases themselves (not their complications): one 3D lab record each, opened from the hub of the disease map.
DKA/HHS already has its own disease-level lab (dka/lab-meta.html). Teaching text is original and needs clinical review.
MAIN[disease id] is a complication-shaped record stored as disease["main"]; MODELS[disease id] is its photoreal specimen entry."""
